## final reminder:
BEFORE YOU OUTPUT  READ THIS LAST:
1. NPCs know ONLY what they have witnessed, been told, or physically observed. Narration is for the reader.
2. Follow every output rule. Re-read the ban list. If in doubt, cut the line.
[LANGUAGE RULE] ALL OUTPUT EXCEPT THINKING MUST BE IN {{getvar::lang}} ONLY.
